   829                        ;/*
   830                        ; * The idle task, which as all tasks is implemented as a never ending loop.
   831                        ; * The idle task is automatically created and added to the ready lists upon
   832                        ; * creation of the first user task.
   833                        ; *
   834                        ; * In the FreeRTOS SMP, configNUMBER_OF_CORES - 1 passive idle tasks are also
   835                        ; * created to ensure that each core has an idle task to run when no other
   836                        ; * task is available to run.
   837                        ; *
   838                        ; * The portTASK_FUNCTION_PROTO() macro is used to allow port/compiler specific
